# Ordered synchronous browser-handler bindings.
#
# The browser worker used to repeat this inventory as an array literal in
# js/worker/formal_ai_worker_dispatch.js.  Keeping the binding name,
# arguments and result guards here makes one Links Notation document the
# authority for both membership and first-match-wins order.  Child node names
# are executable symbols rather than natural-language meaning references.
